# Title: Terminal Service Process Spawn
# ID: 1012f107-b8f1-4271-af30-5aed2de89b39
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2019-05-22
# Tags: attack.initial-access, attack.t1190, attack.lateral-movement, attack.t1210, car.2013-07-002
# Description: Detects a process spawned by the terminal service server process (this could be an indicator for an exploitation of CVE-2019-0708)
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.parent.command_line:*\\svchost.exe* AND process.parent.command_line:*termsvcs*)) AND NOT ((((process.executable:*\\rdpclip.exe OR process.executable:*:\\Windows\\System32\\csrss.exe OR process.executable:*:\\Windows\\System32\\wininit.exe OR process.executable:*:\\Windows\\System32\\winlogon.exe)) OR (NOT _exists_:process.executable))))
